[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0105","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0105.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0120","title":"Allaire Spectra Remote Access Service 安全绕过漏洞","description":"Allaire Spectra 1.0 的远程访问服务 invoke.cfm 模板存在身份认证绕过漏洞。攻击者可通过向该模板提交 bAuthenticated 参数绕过认证检查，无需提供有效凭证即可直接访问受限资源。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 7.5，可能导致敏感信息泄露、数据篡改等严重后果。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0120"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:02Z","remediation":"升级 Allaire Spectra 至 1.0.1 或更高版本，该版本已修复 invoke.cfm 模板的认证绕过问题。临时缓解措施可在 Web 服务器（IIS/Apache）层面限制对 invoke.cfm 的访问，仅允许受信 IP 范围访问 Remote Access Service 管理路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/955","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4025","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2d894f23944bb9acf861e3c6e192d8f723b95560/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0120.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0120","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0120.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/97b4cb3f61e03100104d7050d5d2fad3d3489e66/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0120.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/37358611606378c1ef62b2ed4e6b7dfbe11dca04/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-h7qr-7qxg-9c44/GHSA-h7qr-7qxg-9c44.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0120.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001071.txt","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idbypass"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0105.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0056","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0056.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0069","title":"Sun Solstice Backup recover 程序本地敏感文件泄露漏洞","description":"Solstice Backup（Sun Microsystems 出品的备份恢复软件）中的 recover 程序存在权限检查缺失漏洞，本地攻击者可利用该程序恢复系统中本不应被访问的敏感文件，导致信息泄露。该漏洞需要攻击者已拥有本地系统访问权限，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。受影响版本包括 Solstice Backup 5.1、6.0 及早期版本，建议用户升级至最新版本或限制 recover 程序的可执行权限。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0069"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:56Z","remediation":"升级 Solstice Backup 至 5.1 及以上版本，或限制 recover 程序的执行权限（chmod 750 /usr/sbin/recover），仅允许备份管理员组执行。同时通过文件系统权限（chmod 600）保护敏感备份文件，避免被未授权本地用户读取。若无法升级，可移除 recover 程序的 setuid 位（chmod u-s /usr/sbin/recover）作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0069","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4382b0b8593e7ef30616ab300314afbbf1571636/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0069.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0069","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/919d6cac5eadae13826d4a35bab84cf2bac57965/2000/CVE-2000-0069.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0069.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29756569ae7c866e39492d6faf2dcdff310590f7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6jjp-38m8-v25v/GHSA-6jjp-38m8-v25v.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cae595683b6fe65324ec717750e7cdca928c1db7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0069.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe9