000/AVE-2000-0012.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0100","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0100.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0043","title":"BroadGun Software CamShot WebCam HTTP 服务程序缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"BroadGun Software CamShot WebCam 2.5 的 HTTP 服务器组件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标设备发送超长 GET 请求触发缓冲区溢出，进而执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 CamShot WebCam 2.5 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。厂商至今未发布官方补丁，建议用户停止使用该产品。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0043"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-30T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:53Z","remediation":"由于 BroadGun Software 已停止维护 CamShot WebCam，建议立即停用该版本或隔离至独立网段；在防火墙上限制仅可信 IP 访问 80/8080 端口，并禁用不必要的 HTTP 服务；如果仍需使用摄像头功能，应迁移至受支持的现代替代方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/905","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19702","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a986b2f03c729ac57ae7d269a03d86211c579de0/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0043.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0043","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0043.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/834e72bf1d790a78930554cd283f772f3690fc67/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0043.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e669c67db66703b1cd1a71caf9906b2668093a4d/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gp47-j2wc-phgv/GHSA-gp47-j2wc-phgv.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0043.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--403558bc-fe47-46cc-8a0b-cb316