该产品已停止维护，无官方补丁。建议立即迁移至受支持的现代搜索引擎（如 Apache Solr 或 Elasticsearch），并停止使用 AltaVista Search Intranet。临时缓解措施：在 Web 服务器层配置访问控制，禁止外部访问 query.cgi 脚本，或移除该 CGI 文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/15","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/896","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19694","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/59955f89028f6eb26686f8a6493373afe445701a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0039.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0039","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0039.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/834e72bf1d790a78930554cd283f772f3690fc67/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0039.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e52c2c075f8ae41771cb3f6120956c7f745eea35/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5p9q-hpm8-jw92/GHSA-5p9q-hpm8-jw92.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/web-cgi.rules","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/A/altavista_search.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0039.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154000_154100.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000974.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0036.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0010","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0010.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0009","title":"Nortel Networks Optivity NETarchitect 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Nortel Networks Optivity NETarchitect 2.0 中的 bna_pass 程序在调用系统 rm 命令时依赖 PATH 环境变量来定位可执行文件，未使用绝对路径，构成安全漏洞。本地攻击者可通过修改 PATH 环境变量，将恶意程序替换为 rm 并在 bna_pass 执行时被调用，从而以 bna_pass 进程权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Optivity NETarchitect 2.0 版本，攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0009"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-29T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:48Z","remediation":"将 bna_pass 程序中对 rm 的调用改为使用绝对路径 /bin/rm，或在执行 system() 前将 PATH 环境变量重置为安全值（如 /bin:/usr/bin），避免继承用户的 PATH 环境变量。同时设置程序以最小权限运行，禁止 SUID 提权。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/907","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19704","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9b8712ba896f892b31b495bb919cac52eac29a85/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0009.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0009","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0009.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9da4ebcefe304654f22bdf6c578568005410bc6c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0009.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/23c72f0e29729596bf60b6750cbec12b936da4bf/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3ch7-w6x4-f69f/GHSA-3ch7-w6x4-f69f.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0009.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153900_154000.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000973.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/9d0315205d43d95e2c2bb89a3750b8aa22a01721/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0010.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0010.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0010.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0008","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0008.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0007","title":"Trend Micro PC-Cillin 6.0 内部代理端口未授权访问导致远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Trend Micro PC-Cillin 6.0 防病毒软件内置的代理服务器组件存在访问控制缺陷，该代理端口未对远程连接进行任何身份验证或来源限制，导致未经认证的远程攻击者可直接向代理端口发送恶意请求，耗尽系统资源或造成代理服务崩溃，从而引发拒绝服务（DoS）。攻击者无需任何权限，仅通过网络即可发起攻击，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。受影响的 Trend Micro PC-Cillin 6.0 版本用户需升级至修复版本以消除风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0007"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-29T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:48Z","remediation":"升级到 Trend Micro PC-Cillin 7.0 或更高版本。如无法升级，在防火墙层面限制对内部代理端口（默认 1080/tcp）的外部访问，仅允许受信 IP 连接；同时在软件设置中为代理组件添加访问认证或绑定到本地回环地址。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1740","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4491","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c8f1603cb76d37d7aca26a74458e0aff33b0985a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0007.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0007","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0007.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1baa87c09640becdfd7ca993d7d2150d97be85a6/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0007.json","https://github.com/stg-tud/cveenhance/blob/6476e73d87cdc9cf610342ef15d131432ab41588/Annotations/Wollny/CVE-2000-0007.xml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/23c72f0e29729596bf60b6750cbec12b936da4bf/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mh88-2q4r-3gq4/GHSA-mh88-2q4r-3gq4.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2